18. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 Year 2008 concerning Implementation of Child Protection;
19. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection of the Republic of Indonesia Number 01 Year 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards (SPM) for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2010 Number 56);
20. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 5 Year 2010 concerning Guidelines for Establishment and Development of Integrated Service Centers;
21. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 Year 2011 concerning Empowerment of Child Victims of Violence;
